{"channelId":"UCCfX6XxvvsMF8VzL9Vfu78Q","row":["Travis Ehlers, DC, CCSP",110,"Elite Performance Chiropractic, based in San Diego and led by Dr. Travis Ehlers, is committed to helping patients reach their highest level of health and performance. While the clinic has a strong focus on treating sports-related injuries, it also offers expert care for children, personal injury cases, auto accidents and workplace injuries. Their approach emphasizes whole-body wellness, combining personalized treatment plans with advanced techniques such as soft tissue therapy, cupping, and shockwave therapy. Whether you’re recovering from an injury or looking to optimize your physical well-being, their team provides attentive, results-driven chiropractic care tailored to your needs.","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCCfX6XxvvsMF8VzL9Vfu78Q","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCCfX6XxvvsMF8VzL9Vfu78Q","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:14.470Z","channelId":"UCCfX6XxvvsMF8VzL9Vfu78Q","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"aedf400362fcd9ea35c9c53f8fd6442013fd31f7ff479bfaaa61b2d9a8793701","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"7f7a890bc75a309bfdd82e7d1d737523bf2e1898fec15f69a5a91da80c7b2d21"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCCfX6XxvvsMF8VzL9Vfu78Q","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":110,"raw":"110 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCCfX6XxvvsMF8VzL9Vfu78Q","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:14.470Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"chiropractors","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"single_sample","role":"undetermined","flags":["当前仅有相关内容或名称线索，尚无匹配的本人专业简介；不列入职业联系优选"],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NRXsIOmNRwM"]}],"cleanup":{"status":"review","code":"biography_audience_review","reason":"简介上下文未证明本人与目标人群的关系；保留原记录，不猜测身份。","key